<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
	</head>
	<body>
		Your REON account is ready. Welcome aboard.<br>
		<br>
		<strong>Your username is {{ username }}</strong>, and your mailbox answers on two
		addresses &mdash; both reach the same inbox:<br>
		<br>
		From the internet: <code>{{ external_email }}</code><br>
		{% if external_email_short != external_email %}
		&nbsp;&nbsp;or <code>{{ external_email_short }}</code><br>
		{% endif %}
		From the Game Boy: <code>{{ dion_email }}</code><br>
		<br>
		{% if mail_truncated %}
		The Game Boy only holds 8 characters, which is why the in-game address is
		your username shortened &mdash; both reach the same inbox.<br>
		<br>
		{% endif %}
		Your DION ID is <code>{{ dion_id }}</code>. You will need it, along with your
		Log-In Password, when setting up the Mobile Adapter &mdash; both are on your
		account page at
		<a href="https://{{ hostname }}/user/summary.php">https://{{ hostname }}/user/summary.php</a>,
		together with the configuration file the adapter downloads.<br>
		<br>
		You can also read and write mail from the web, without the Game Boy, at
		<a href="https://{{ hostname }}/user/mail.php">https://{{ hostname }}/user/mail.php</a>.<br>
		<br>
		REON is in alpha testing, so expect the occasional rough edge.
	</body>
</html>
